.TH RANMA-UPGRADE 1 "" "ranma 0.1.0" "ranma manual"
.SH NAME
ranma\-upgrade \- Move running servers to the installed build without closing anything: every shell, pane and scrollback stays. \fBinstall.sh\fR runs \fB\-\-all\fR
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBranma upgrade\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move running servers to the installed build without closing anything: every shell, pane and scrollback stays. \fBinstall.sh\fR runs \fB\-\-all\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Every server
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
The server (as \fBranma ls\fR names it); the one this runs in when left out
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBranma\fR(1)
